{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你回转，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回转归向我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从我眼前除掉可憎的神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再离开我；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果你本着诚实、正直、公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凭永活的耶和华起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必成为万国的祝福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得到他们的尊敬","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华对犹大人和耶路撒冷人说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“要开垦你们的荒地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在荆棘中撒种。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大人和耶路撒冷的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要自行割礼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除掉心中的污垢，归向耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，我必因你们的恶行而发烈怒，如火燃烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能够扑灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“你们要在犹大传讲，在耶路撒冷宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘要在全国吹响号角。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高声呼喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘要集合起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们要逃进坚城。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要向锡安举起旗帜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赶快逃亡，不要迟延，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我要从北方降下灾祸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大肆毁灭。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭列国者已出动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如狮子冲出巢穴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使你们的土地荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑沦为废墟，无人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为此，你们要腰束麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嚎啕大哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华向我们发的烈怒还没有止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和华说：“到那天，君王必吓坏，官长必丧胆，祭司和先知必惊骇。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我说：“唉！主耶和华啊，你完全欺骗了这群百姓和耶路撒冷人，因为你说，‘你们会安享太平。’其实剑锋已抵着他们的咽喉了。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那时，耶和华必对这群百姓和耶路撒冷人说：“一阵热风从荒野光秃的山头吹向我的子民，不是为扬场、吹净糠秕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那是我发出的一阵强风。现在我要宣告我对他们的审判。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"看啊，仇敌必如云涌来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的战车快如旋风，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的战马比飞鹰还快。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们灭亡了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要洗去你内心的邪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样你才能得救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你心怀恶念要到何时呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从但传来消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从以法莲山区报出恶讯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“你们去通知列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向耶路撒冷宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘围攻的人从远方来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向犹大的城邑高声喊杀，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像看守田园一样包围耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶路撒冷背叛了我。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的所作所为给你招致这灾祸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是罪有应得，你会痛彻心肺！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"我的心啊，我的心啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我伤心欲绝，烦躁不安。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我无法保持缄默，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我听见了号角声和战争的呐喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶讯频传，山河破碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的帐篷忽然倒塌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幔子顷刻破裂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我还要看这旌旗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听这号声到何时呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我的子民愚顽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不认识我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是蒙昧无知的儿女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"善于行恶，不知行善。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我俯瞰大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只见一片空虚混沌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我观看天空，毫无亮光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我眺望群山，只见大山在颤抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"小山在摇晃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我四下观看，只见杳无人烟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飞鸟绝迹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我四下观看，只见良田变荒野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑都在耶和华的烈怒下沦为废墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“遍地将要荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而我不会彻底毁灭大地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，地要悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天要昏暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我言出必行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心意已决，绝不反悔。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各城的人听到骑兵和弓箭手的呐喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都纷纷逃命。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有的跑入丛林，有的爬进岩洞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各城荒弃，无人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这荒凉的城啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在做什么？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"纵然你穿上红袍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戴上金饰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"描眉画眼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有什么用呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的情人藐视你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要杀害你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我听见好像妇人分娩时的喊叫声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像妇人生头胎时的痛苦呻吟。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是少女锡安的喊叫声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她在喘息，伸出双手说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“噢！我有祸了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要死在杀戮者手上了。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“你必成为万国的祝福，得到他们的尊敬”或译“万国必得到耶和华的祝福，并以祂为荣”。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}